SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5 (runes) + TypeScript strict, self-hosted via Node adapter. Self-hosted analytics is a web app, not a desktop app: @sveltejs/adapter-node produces a server docker compose runs. Rationale over Tauri: requirement is 'self-hosted' (server + volume), keeps the whole stack in one language for the hexagonal core.
