-> HAS_FACET [node:611fe614-2e32-4e71-bca8-be7d434edfc6] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.552970+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:b4448ae8-c0d3-4aca-a3ad-8598096b957a] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.552970+00:00

Hexagonal architecture, explicit composition root. src/lib/core (pure domain: import pipeline, classification engine, analytics) imports only src/lib/ports. Adapters in src/lib/adapters. One typed composition root (src/lib/server/container.ts, server-only) wires adapters from config — constructor injection, no DI framework. A boundary-lint test enforces core purity.
