-> DEPENDS_ON [node:c282e44d-4e69-49ff-aafd-b8f233a012e7] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.642250+00:00

Description normalization for HASHING is defined once in core (src/lib/core/normalize/description.ts) and shared by every parser: collapse internal whitespace, trim, uppercase-fold, strip diacritics FOR THE HASH ONLY (never for display). The content hash is a stable digest of (account, booking date, amount-minor+currency, normalized-description). This makes import idempotent and locale/whitespace-stable across parsers.
---
