-> HAS_FACET [node:1115b42c-b4ec-4a74-affb-9d2f09db206f] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.678746+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:b4448ae8-c0d3-4aca-a3ad-8598096b957a] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.678746+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:c282e44d-4e69-49ff-aafd-b8f233a012e7] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.678746+00:00

Money.minor is bigint, not number, to guarantee no float drift under any arithmetic later phases perform. money(minor, currency) accepts a bigint or safe-integer number, normalizes currency to upper-case. directionOf derives Direction from sign; zero is defined as 'in' by convention (documented, not silently assumed).
---
