formatMoney(amount, minorDigits=2) is deliberately NOT locale/currency-symbol aware — a debugging/interchange helper, not a display formatter. Core has no currency->decimal-places table; callers needing zero-decimal currencies (e.g. JPY) pass minorDigits:0 explicitly. Real display formatting belongs to a future UI/adapter layer (slice 4 i18n).
