ConfigPort is { get<T>(path, defaultValue?): T; getAll(): AppConfig }. get() throws 'Config path not found: "<path>"' when the dot-path is missing and no defaultValue was given. AppConfig shape: { db: { path }, locale: { default }, import: { enabledParsers: ParserId[] }, assist: { adapter: AssistAdapterKind; enabled: boolean } }. ParserId is 'csv'|'ofx'|'generic-tabular-pdf' widened with (string & {}) so BankProfile-style future ids typecheck without a union edit.
