Migration runner applies migrations/*.sql in lexicographic order, tracked in a schema_migrations table it creates itself; each file applies inside its own transaction alongside the bookkeeping insert, so migrate() is idempotent. 001_init.sql creates import_batches and transactions (content_hash TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE — the dedup constraint) plus an index on import_batch_id.
