-> HAS_FACET [node:b176a9c6-63b8-4ee6-901c-ac6e42bed5fa] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.712334+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:b4448ae8-c0d3-4aca-a3ad-8598096b957a] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.712334+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:c282e44d-4e69-49ff-aafd-b8f233a012e7] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.712334+00:00

save() uses one prepared INSERT OR IGNORE statement inside a single transaction over all rows, counting info.changes per row to report {inserted, duplicates} without ever throwing on a UNIQUE violation — a no-op counted as a duplicate, not an error. The in-memory fake mirrors this with a Map keyed by contentHash; the observable contract is identical.
