-> HAS_FACET [node:b4448ae8-c0d3-4aca-a3ad-8598096b957a] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.724069+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:fd58f2e6-cccc-4af5-8a98-095acb6e0b43] @ 2026-07-24T10:15:19.724069+00:00

CSV parsing is a hand-rolled RFC-4180-ish state machine (quote handling, comma/semicolon delimiter auto-detection, decimal-comma vs decimal-dot detection). OFX parsing is a small regex-based <TAG>value extractor scoped per <STMTTRN> block, handling both SGML-unclosed (OFX 1.x) and XML-closed (OFX 2.x) forms with one extraction function — no new dependency added, matching the dependency-light PDF-port rationale.
---
