coffer-classification assignments carry provenance: source 'rule'|'manual'|'assist' (+ ruleId? for rule-sourced). Re-running the rule engine is ADDITIVE and idempotent and MUST NEVER delete a manual correction — manual assignments are sticky; re-evaluation only adds/refreshes rule-sourced rows. Review queue is a DERIVED read (transactions with zero group assignments), not a separately persisted queue; a correction removes a tx from the queue by creating an assignment. Assignments key transactions by content_hash (the stable natural key; the domain Transaction has no surrogate id). Preserves dec:6 many-to-many.
