coffer-classification correction-to-rule flow: a manual (re)assignment can be PROMOTED to a reusable Rule whose predicate is derived from the corrected tx (default: counterparty-equals, or description-equals when counterparty is empty) and whose assign is the corrected group set. Appending the rule and re-running the engine reproduces the correction for every matching tx, while the originating manual assignment stays sticky. Implements dec:6 'correction-to-rule'.
