coffer-classification AssistPort: suggest(tx) -> ranked Suggestion[] { groupId, score }, NEVER commits (commit is a rule/manual action). Default 'heuristic' adapter scores candidate groups by frequency/similarity over past classified transactions, tokenizing descriptions via the shared core normalize-for-hash function (uppercase-fold + diacritic-strip) for locale-stable matching. The 'llm' (Anthropic Haiku) adapter is a constructor-injected TRANSPORT STUB, off by default via existing assist config (adapter/enabled), and faked in tests — NO network on any pnpm verification path. Heuristic tuning params read via config.get with defaults, so AppConfig shape is unchanged. Implements dec:7.
