-> HAS_FACET [node:b176a9c6-63b8-4ee6-901c-ac6e42bed5fa] @ 2026-07-24T10:28:28.335894+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:b4448ae8-c0d3-4aca-a3ad-8598096b957a] @ 2026-07-24T10:28:28.335894+00:00

better-sqlite3 (like all SQLite) has foreign-key enforcement OFF by default: every new connection must run PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON or declared FKs are decorative; multi-connection setups also need PRAGMA busy_timeout to avoid SQLITE_BUSY on near-simultaneous writes. Found by the slice-2 plan-review gate; applies to every sqlite adapter in this project (slice-1 SqliteStoreAdapter had the same latent gap) and generalizes to any future sqlite use.
---
