coffer-analytics is PROVENANCE-AGNOSTIC: attribution counts the (tx, group) pair, never its source (rule|manual|assist). Therefore the provenance-asymmetry issue [1ea505ed] (a manual re-assignment onto an existing rule-sourced pair stays source:'rule') does NOT affect analytics correctness in v1 - a group membership is a group membership regardless of how it was recorded. Decided: analytics does not need to care about the asymmetry; it is not a blocker for slice 3.
