coffer-analytics reconciliation invariants (TESTED as properties, per currency, bigint minor units): PARTITION sums to the grand total EXACTLY (even-split remainder assigned deterministically so no minor unit is lost); OVERLAP may EXCEED the grand total (each matched group counts the full amount). By-group rollup over the nestable group tree: a tx counts into an ancestor if assigned to that ancestor OR any descendant, counted ONCE per subtree (subtree-dedup) so parent+child assignment is not double-counted; two labeled shapes self (direct) vs rollup (subtree-deduped). Every group-aggregated Series carries its AttributionMode label. Currency: per-currency series, no FX conversion (PRD gap).
