Partition reconciliation includes a synthetic '__unclassified__' series (UNCLASSIFIED_GROUP_ID) per currency for transactions with zero assignments — the review-queue state is normal, so its amounts are shown explicitly rather than silently breaking the sums-to-grand-total invariant. Overlap mode surfaces the same series (queue size is a fact worth showing) without any reconciliation promise. Resolves the gap the slice-3 review flagged; tested with mixed assigned/unassigned fixtures. UI (slice 4) should render the unclassified series distinctly.
