coffer-ui-i18n no-hardcoded-string guard: a vitest scan (modelled on the existing boundary-lint.test.ts file-walk) over src/routes/** and src/lib/ui/** that flags (a) template text nodes containing a letter that are not a {t(...)} mustache, and (b) static values of user-facing attributes title/aria-label/placeholder/alt that are not {t(...)}. Pragmatic exclusions: <script>/<style> regions; structural attrs class/style/href/id/role/type/name/data-* incl data-testid; strings with no alphabetic char (punctuation/number/currency glyph); and an explicit allowlist array (e.g. the brand token 'Coffer'). Group names are USER DATA and are never flagged (chrome-translated-only per constraint aeb2d1f6).
