coffer-ui-i18n auth gate (implements 74be155e): src/hooks.server.ts handle (composed via sequence() with a locale-negotiation handle) gates ALL routes incl /api/**; unauthed page GET -> 303 /login, unauthed API/non-GET -> 401; /login and static assets exempt. Passphrase read via ConfigPort config.get('auth.password') (env COFFER_AUTH__PASSWORD; no default -> fail-closed), compared with node:crypto timingSafeEqual over equal-length SHA-256 digests (constant-time, no length leak). Session = HttpOnly+Secure+SameSite=Lax cookie 'coffer_session' holding an HMAC-SHA256(payload, serverSecret) signature verified per request. ALL node:crypto lives in src/lib/server/auth/*.ts + hooks.server.ts (server/hooks land, hexagonal — NEVER core). /login (+page.svelte in the design system, i18n'd) + /login/+page.server.ts form action set the cookie; /logout action clears it.
