coffer-ui-i18n P2 implemented: src/lib/i18n/{messages/{types,en,pl}.ts,keys.ts,t.ts,locale.ts,format.ts}. Catalog uses `satisfies Record<string, MessageValue>` (not `as const`) on en.ts so MessageKey stays literal-keyed while string VALUES stay widened to `string` (translatable) and function VALUES keep their exact param-type signature; pl.ts types itself as `Catalog = {[K in MessageKey]: typeof en[K]}`, so a missing/mistyped pl key is a typecheck failure by construction. t(locale,key,params?) uses overloads keyed off whether en[key] is a function, so param-less keys reject a params arg and interpolated keys require one. 37 catalog keys covering nav/common/auth/dashboard/import/review/settings chrome in the fantasy register both languages (dashboard=The Treasury/Skarbiec, import=Tally the Takings/Zliczanie Łupów, review=The Scriptorium/Skryptorium, settings=The Steward's Study/Gabinet Zarządcy).
