First-boot robustness for the sqlite store: SqliteStoreAdapter mkdirs the db file's parent directory (recursive) before opening — better-sqlite3 refuses to create the file otherwise, 500ing every fresh deployment. Migrations are inlined via Vite ?raw imports (MIGRATIONS array in migration-runner.ts) because the adapter-node bundle does not ship the migrations/ dir — readdirSync at runtime 500s in production builds (same failure class punktomat hit). Adding a migration = add .sql file + one MIGRATIONS entry.
